      "description": "Detects calibration beads (e.g. tetraspeck) that are fluorescent in all channels; the analysis removes every spot overlapping one.\n1. Enable this pipeline\n2. Select the tetraspeck image channel (channel showing only tetraspecks)\n3. Adapt the threshold",
